{"id":"d50ea467-6138-4ab2-9a5a-004059dde883","createdAt":"2026-10-26T13:39:16.002Z","batchId":"pricing_glm-5-3-flash-opencode-go_high","approach":"html","modelId":"glm-5.3-flash-opencode-go","settings":{"effort":"high"},"presetId":"pricing","prompt":"A pricing page with three plans (Free, Pro, Team), their features and a call to action for each.","system":"Return only the body content of an HTML page: no doctype, <html>, <head> or <body> tags, no markdown, no code fences, no prose. The page shell below is already loaded, so build with its classes and chart helper. Inline <script> is allowed for interactivity (tabs, toggles, filters); no external requests. Add a small <style> block only for what the classes cannot express, or when the request asks for a different look, colours, fonts or layout: then follow the request.\nPAGE SHELL (already loaded; do not restate it):\n- A stylesheet with these classes. Use them instead of writing CSS:\n  layout: page (centered column), stack, row, between, center, gap-sm, gap-lg, grid + cols-2|cols-3|cols-4 (responsive)\n  surfaces: card, card-title, card-desc, alert, alert-destructive, hr\n  text: h1-h4 (styled), lead, muted, small, up, down (trend colours)\n  controls: btn, btn-secondary|btn-outline|btn-ghost|btn-destructive, btn-sm|btn-lg, btn-block; label wraps input/select/textarea; label.check wraps a checkbox or radio\n  data: table (styled; td.num for numbers), badge, badge-secondary|badge-outline|badge-destructive, stat-label, stat-value, progress (inner div with style=\"width:NN%\"), avatar\n- Charts: <div data-chart='{\"type\":\"bar|line|area|pie\",\"title\":\"…\",\"data\":[{\"label\":\"W1\",\"value\":120}]}'></div> renders an SVG chart (single series, pie gets a legend). Do not draw charts yourself.\n- Light and dark mode are handled by the stylesheet.\n\nDESIGN BRIEF (applies to every UI you produce):\n- Build a complete, realistic screen, not a skeleton: a clear title and intro, grouped sections, and enough detail that it could ship.\n- Cover exactly what the request names, with no extra pages or marketing sections.\n- Use the supplied DATA in full: every field is there to be shown. Derive useful extras from it (shares, totals, deltas, rankings) instead of inventing unrelated numbers.\n- Where it fits, add status badges, trend/change figures, secondary actions, helper text, and sensible empty or edge-case copy.\n- Establish hierarchy with headings, size and weight; group related items; keep spacing and alignment consistent.\n- Make charts readable: a title, labelled axes or values, and a legend for pie charts.\n- Never use lorem ipsum or placeholder names like \"Item 1\".","systemHash":"0c16911c9564c3db3ada7a622931ee6ffc820ebf9a373996782a9f1f0fc3c98c","systemOverridden":false,"strictOutput":false,"rawOutput":"```html\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"stack gap-lg\" style=\"max-width: 1080px; width: 100%;\">\n\n    <header class=\"stack gap-sm center\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n      <h1>Pricing</h1>\n      <p class=\"lead\">Start free and scale as your team grows. Every paid plan includes a 14-day free trial — no credit card required.</p>\n      <span class=\"muted small\">All prices in USD. Switch, downgrade or cancel at any time.</span>\n    </header>\n\n    <div class=\"row center gap-sm\">\n      <label class=\"check\">\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"billing\" value=\"monthly\" checked onchange=\"setBilling('monthly')\">\n        Monthly billing\n      </label>\n      <label class=\"check\">\n        <input type=\"radio\" name=\"billing\" value=\"annual\" onchange=\"setBilling('annual')\">\n        Annual billing\n        <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Save up to 25%</span>\n      </label>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"grid cols-3\">\n\n      <!-- Free -->\n      <div class=\"card stack\">\n        <div class=\"row between center\">\n          <h3 style=\"margin: 0;\">Free</h3>\n          <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">For individuals</span>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <span class=\"stat-value\">$0</span>\n          <span class=\"muted small\"> forever</span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin: 0;\">Everything you need to try the product and ship your first project.</p>\n        <hr>\n        <ul class=\"features\">\n          <li>3 active projects</li>\n          <li>5 GB storage</li>\n          <li>1 seat</li>\n          <li>Core integrations (Slack, GitHub)</li>\n          <li>Basic analytics</li>\n          <li>Community support</li>\n        </ul>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-outline btn-block\" onclick=\"startPlan('Free')\">Start for free</button>\n        <span class=\"muted small center\">Free forever. No credit card required.</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Pro -->\n      <div class=\"card stack plan-featured\">\n        <div class=\"row between center\">\n          <h3 style=\"margin: 0;\">Pro</h3>\n          <span class=\"badge\">Most popular</span>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <span class=\"stat-value\" data-monthly=\"$12\" data-annual=\"$9\">$12</span>\n          <span class=\"muted small\"> /user/month</span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin: 0;\">For professionals who need unlimited projects, insights and priority help.</p>\n        <hr>\n        <p class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0;\"><strong>Everything in Free, plus:</strong></p>\n        <ul class=\"features\">\n          <li>Unlimited projects</li>\n          <li>100 GB storage per seat</li>\n          <li>Advanced analytics &amp; reports</li>\n          <li>Custom domain with SSL</li>\n          <li>Full REST &amp; GraphQL API</li>\n          <li>Unlimited integrations</li>\n          <li>Priority email support — 24h response</li>\n        </ul>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-block\" onclick=\"startPlan('Pro')\">Start 14-day free trial</button>\n        <span class=\"muted small center\" data-monthly-note=\"Billed monthly. Cancel anytime.\" data-annual-note=\"Billed annually — $108/user per year.\">Billed monthly. Cancel anytime.</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Team -->\n      <div class=\"card stack\">\n        <div class=\"row between center\">\n          <h3 style=\"margin: 0;\">Team</h3>\n          <span class=\"badge badge-secondary\">Collaboration</span>\n        </div>\n        <div>\n          <span class=\"stat-value\" data-monthly=\"$29\" data-annual=\"$23\">$29</span>\n          <span class=\"muted small\"> /user/month</span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin: 0;\">Security, controls and support for teams that run on the product daily.</p>\n        <hr>\n        <p class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin: 0 0 8px 0;\"><strong>Everything in Pro, plus:</strong></p>\n        <ul class=\"features\">\n          <li>Unlimited seats &amp; centralized billing</li>\n          <li>1 TB pooled storage</li>\n          <li>Roles &amp; granular permissions</li>\n          <li>SSO / SAML single sign-on</li>\n          <li>Audit log &amp; activity history</li>\n          <li>99.9% uptime SLA</li>\n          <li>Dedicated success manager</li>\n        </ul>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-secondary btn-block\" onclick=\"startPlan('Team')\">Start 14-day free trial</button>\n        <span class=\"muted small center\" data-monthly-note=\"Billed monthly. Volume pricing from 25 seats.\" data-annual-note=\"Billed annually — $276/user per year.\">Billed monthly. Volume pricing from 25 seats.</span>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <span class=\"card-title\">Every plan includes</span>\n      <p class=\"card-desc\">No matter which tier you pick, the fundamentals are always on.</p>\n      <div class=\"row gap-sm\" style=\"flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n        <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Two-factor authentication</span>\n        <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">SSL on all domains</span>\n        <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Daily backups</span>\n        <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">GDPR compliance tools</span>\n        <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">99.5% uptime</span>\n        <span class=\"badge badge-outline\">Cancel anytime</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <p class=\"muted small center\" style=\"margin: 0;\">\n      Prices exclude VAT where applicable. Plan changes take effect immediately and are prorated at the next billing cycle.\n      Questions about enterprise volumes? Talk to us at <strong>sales@nimbus.app</strong>.\n    </p>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .features {\n    list-style: none;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    display: grid;\n    gap: 8px;\n  }\n  .features li {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 10px;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.45;\n  }\n  .features li::before {\n    content: \"✓\";\n    font-weight: 700;\n    flex: none;\n  }\n  .plan-featured {\n    border-width: 2px;\n  }\n</style>\n\n<script>\n  function setBilling(mode) {\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-monthly]').forEach(function (el) {\n      el.textContent = mode === 'annual' ? el.dataset.annual : el.dataset.monthly;\n    });\n    document.querySelectorAll('[data-monthly-note]').forEach(function (el) {\n      el.textContent = mode === 'annual' ? el.dataset.annualNote : el.dataset.monthlyNote;\n    });\n  }\n\n  function startPlan(plan) {\n    var notice = document.createElement('div');\n    notice.className = 'alert';\n    notice.style.position = 'fixed';\n    notice.style.bottom = '24px';\n    notice.style.left = '50%';\n    notice.style.transform = 'translateX(-50%)';\n    notice.style.zIndex = '50';\n    notice.style.boxShadow = '0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.15)';\n    notice.textContent = plan === 'Free'\n      ? 'Free plan activated — welcome aboard!'\n      : 'Your 14-day ' + plan + ' trial has started. Enjoy!';\n    document.body.appendChild(notice);\n    setTimeout(function () { notice.remove(); }, 3200);\n  }\n</script>\n```","deltas":[[98